  "reference": "Jɔ̱Ɔ̱N 2",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 25,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "2",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JHN 2"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "2",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kuën kä Keena",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ni̱ni da̱ŋ rɛw cuɛ tekɛ kuën kä Keena ro̱o̱l Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, kä te man Yecu thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cua Yecu cɔal kuen bä, kɛnɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci kɔaŋ thuɔ̱k, cu man Yecu, Yecu jiök i̱, “Thilɛ kɛ kɔaŋ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu jɛ jiök i̱, “Ciek, ɛŋu mi latdi kɛ ɣä? Ŋot gua̱a̱thdä /kenɛ ni cop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu man la̱a̱t jiök i̱, “La̱tdɛ min bi Yecu ɛ la̱r yɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ tekɛ dha̱a̱ri da̱ŋ bäkɛl tin di̱t ti naŋ kɛl jaluuni pi̱i̱ni thi̱n. Ca kɛ nööŋ kɛ la̱k kɛ ciaŋ ji̱ Juudh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu la̱a̱t jiök i̱, “Thia̱ŋɛ dha̱a̱ri kɛ pi̱.” Kä cukɛ kɛ thiäŋ amäni ŋɛpkiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Täämɛ, kua ŋɔak jɔm, kä nöŋɛ kɛ gua̱n bo̱thni.” Kä cukɛ kɛ naŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci gua̱n bo̱thni pi̱ met, tin ca rɔ̱ pay looc ni kɔaŋ, kä kui̱cɛ gua̱a̱th ɔ bä kɛ jɛ mɔ a cäŋ ŋa̱ckɛ jɛ ɛ la̱a̱t tin ca kɛ jɔm, cuɛ cɔ nyaal cɔl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu gua̱n bo̱thni jɛ jiök i̱, “La nɛy diaal kɔaŋ dɛɛni wal ti gɔw a käm naath kɛ nhiam, kä mëë ci naath diaal ku maath a com, ba kɔaaŋ ti ba̱l ba̱a̱l nööŋ kɔɔr, kä cu ji̱n kɔaaŋ ti gɔw gän amäni täämɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu nyuuthdɛ min jio̱l ɛmɛ la̱t kä Keena ro̱o̱l Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, kä cuɛ puɔ̱nydɛ nyuɔ̱th naath. Kä cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jɛ ŋäth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä mɛmɛ cuɛ wä kä Ka-pɛr-ni-äm kɛnɛ man, kɛ dämani amäni ji̱ kɔaarɛ, kä cukɛ ni̱n ti tɔt nin thi̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jak Yecu luaak Kuɔth kä gɔaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mëë ci gua̱a̱th ti̱mä Ca̱ŋ Bälä ji̱ Juudh thia̱k, cu Yecu wä kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuɛ nɛy ti kɔakɛ ɣɔ̱k, kɛ det, kɛnɛ guukuri (kiɛ kunööri) jek rɛy luaak Kuɔth, kä te nɛy tin luɛlkɛ yio̱w nyuurä gua̱a̱th la̱tdiɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ waat la̱t kɛ dep, cuɛ ley diaal juɔc raar rɛy luaak Kuɔth kɛnɛ det kɛ ɣɔ̱k kɛɛl, cuɛ tharbëtni nɛɛni tin luɛlkɛ yio̱w puɔ̱p, kä cuɛ tharbëtnikiɛn buɔ̱p. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cuɛ naath tin kɔakɛ kunööri jiök i̱, “Naŋɛ ti̱ti̱ raar, cuarɛ luaak Gua̱a̱r jakä gua̱a̱th ko̱kä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ jɛ tim ɛn ɣöö ca gɔ̱r i̱,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:17",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Diit 69:9.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Buɔ̱m nho̱kädä kɛ luaakdu lö Kuoth pɛtdɛ rɛydä ce̱tkɛ mac” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ɛnɔ, cu ji̱ Juudh ɛ jiök i̱, “Nyuuthdu ɛŋu kɛ kɔ, ɛn ɣöö ɛ cuɔ̱ɔ̱ŋdu ɛn min lätdi mɛ?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cu Yecu kɛ loc, “Da̱kɛ luaak Kuɔth ɛmɛ, kä bä jɛ nyɔk kɛ lätni kɛ ni̱n da̱ŋ diɔ̱k.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu ji̱ Juudh wee i̱, “Luaak Kuɔth ɛmɛ cɛ run ti jiɛn ŋuan wi̱cdɛ bäkɛl ka̱n kɛ lätnidɛ, kä bi ji̱n ɛ la̱t kɛ ni̱n da̱ŋ diɔ̱k?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ruac Yecu kɛ kui̱ luaak Kuɔth in la puɔ̱nydɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr kä, mëë cɛ rɔ jiɛc li̱th, cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ ruac ëë cɛ lat tim. Kä cukɛ ruaacni Kuɔth tëë ca gɔ̱r kɛnɛ ruac ëë ci Yecu jɛ lat, ŋäth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋäc Yecu kɛ ciaaŋ nath",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ mëë tëë kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm guäth ti̱mä Ca̱ŋ Bälä, cu nɛy ti ŋuan ciötdɛ ŋäth, mëë ca nyuuthni tëë ga̱ykɛ naath tëë cɛ la̱t nɛn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä /ken Yecu rɔɔdɛ ŋa̱th kɛ, kɛ ɣöö ŋäcɛ lo̱c nɛɛni diaal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 2:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä thilɛ ram mi go̱o̱rɛ mi dee jɛ la̱t naath kɛ ɣöö jɛn puɔ̱nydɛ ŋäcɛ min te lo̱cnikiɛn.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.2.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.2.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
